<title>UK: OPEC basket price fell 83 cts last week to $16.91.</title>
<headline>OPEC basket price fell 83 cts last week to $16.91.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The price of OPEC's basket of seven crudes fell to $16.91 per barrel last week from $17.74 the previous week, the OPEC news agency OPECNA said on Monday.</p>
<p>Quoting figures released by the OPEC Secretariat, it said the price so far this year, up to April 10, has averaged $20.28 a barrel.</p>
<p>In March the basket price averaged $18.64, down from $20.48 in February and $23.19 in January, it said.</p>
<p>The basket comprises Algeria's Saharan Blend, Indonesia's Minas, Nigeria's Bonny Light, Saudi Arabia's Arabian Light, Dubai of the UAE, Venezuela's Tia Juana and Mexico's Isthmus.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7629</p>
